<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-FRENCH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FRENCH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the round of 16 of the</p>
<p>French rugby union championship on Sunday (games played on</p>
<p>neutral ground):</p>
<p> Pau	   23  Castres    20</p>
<p> Begles	29  Perpignan  26</p>
<p> Agen	  27  Grenoble   27 (Agen won on number of bookings)</p>
<p> Toulouse    24  Narbonne   22</p>
<p> Colomiers   36  Brive	31</p>
<p> Dax	   22  Biarritz   18</p>
<p> Montferrand 12  Toulon     6</p>
<p> Bourgoin    23  Beziers    14</p>
<p>Quarter-finals draw:</p>
<p>Agen v Begles</p>
<p>Toulouse v Colomiers</p>
<p>Dax v Montferrand</p>
<p>Pau v Bourgoin</p>
</text>
